{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_title", "source_sha256": "d778a46fd3e56864d5379afa3c63cab56c53f917955741df608ff12cb86656d5", "ja": "あなたのすべて", "zh": "你的全部", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_synopsis", "source_sha256": "baea5e22c1539321c81ac30bfa668479d9fd28ee9172f4ab3fd0f1623d2f9343", "ja": "特別企画のため、新曲を貰ったものの、心の\n込め方に迷うあずさに、プロデューサーはポ\nスター撮影を提案する。カメラの前に全てを\nさらけ出したあずさは、新曲との向き合い方\nも見つけるのだった。", "zh": "为了特别企划拿到了新曲，梓却不知道该\n如何注入情感。对此，制作人提议拍摄宣\n传海报。在镜头前展现出一切的梓，也找\n到了面对新曲的方法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e6607009410224e48d4abf26c71ad78f5399bcc980e7240877e2159666c746ae", "ja": "（あずささんの新ソロ曲のレッスンが始まった。今回は\n外部でのライブだが、劇場の皆が協力してくれている）", "zh": "（梓小姐的新个人曲开始练习了。这次虽然是在外部举办的演唱会，但剧场的大家都在帮忙。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "1693739e3edc5954e4f57c3c42340c498927ab694e3a90735ab3b11908284740", "ja": "ふう。なんとか、最後まで歌えたかな……。\nどうだったかしら？", "zh": "呼……总算是唱到最后了吧……\n感觉怎么样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "8da42ec7458c3cea0f4050185ed062d642d116db0f44b0d899ec45167bc3b6a4", "ja": "って、すごいよあずささん！　いきなり上手すぎ！\nね、雪歩？", "zh": "不过，真厉害啊，梓姐！突然唱得这么好！\n对吧，雪步？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d34daca57a867d5dc919885a385a0e2120bd50f407b2f3cd40f844a4e7b49f9a", "ja": "はい、とってもステキでしたぁ。\n声も出ていて、リズムも音程もピッタリで♪", "zh": "是的，真的非常棒。\n声音洪亮，节奏和音准也都恰到好处♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "7fb963cb87551ccb642bb25dc1e8e18f566f1560dc6bd52545f2bc2cfcd7edb1", "ja": "ふふっ、ありがとう。\nでも……ぎこちなくなかった？", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢。\n不过……会不会显得有些生硬？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "da5c8888f711ada18839b3574f82883ceba09e1929726241753228d90783c8ce", "ja": "え、ぎこちない？　うーん、まあ最初だもんね。\n言われてみれば、そんな気も……ってくらい？", "zh": "诶，不自然吗？嗯，毕竟是第一次嘛。\n你这么一说，好像确实有点……大概就是这种感觉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3125b9d315599a9f5c597d27741abbc7896d4b2b1ff22246059e1a8e12433cef", "ja": "えっと……もしかして、表現が足りないとか、\nそういうことですか？", "zh": "那个……难道是说，表现力还不够之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "096dfa4a2d0da28c41aab564efdd556288d92ef27b9bffe10f16d5d73bd2c161", "ja": "そうね。自分ではまだ、ぎこちないっていうか、\nその、恥ずかしいかな、なんて……。", "zh": "是啊。总觉得自己还是有些生硬，怎么说呢，可能……有点害羞吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1008_p", "source_sha256": "817ea75626224f373fbdbd76eac5ec7500cc7331f4db433db986f0c2a168b336", "ja": "なるほど……。気持ちを前に出せていない、\nみたいな感じですか？", "zh": "原来如此……也就是说，还没能把自己的情感表达出来，是这种感觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "b6e5629c7047a91ce624d8d320e95b41b92c87e7f30b4478ae1101f09192540a", "ja": "そうなんです。歌の世界観っていうか、\n気持ちをまだ、全然歌えていないような……。", "zh": "就是这样。该说是还没能唱出歌曲的世界观，还是说……感觉还完全没能把自己的情感唱出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "b252cab79f3c9e5f819d0756dcaf16a1eab4360ee9247049bc942a81dde1e134", "ja": "やっぴょーん！　そーだと思って、\n真美が歌詞の先生を連れてきたよ～！", "zh": "呀吼——！我就猜到了，所以真美把歌词老师带来了哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "643ace8845237a8112fc393560949104ee423320124dc7452f1e7a4401210c76", "ja": "え、えっと……先生ってわけじゃないんですけど、\n真美ちゃんに誘われて……見学に来ちゃいましたっ。", "zh": "呃、那个……我也不算什么老师，只是被真美邀请……就来参观了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "279c689983676a35e8c58507de467b6c4d8e1908d4a2011392cedf7dd49247d0", "ja": "いらっしゃい、百合子ちゃん♪　歌詞の先生って……\nもしかして、歌詞に興味があるの？", "zh": "欢迎你，百合子♪歌词老师是指……\n难道说，你对歌词很感兴趣吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "b487f81cb34c3ebde43a52c74358586427fb76e0746b1033653cd9c5e2d53b4b", "ja": "はい！　今回は大人の恋愛の歌だって聞いて、\n恋が永遠の課題である私としても、放っておけず……。", "zh": "是的！听说这次是关于大人恋爱的歌曲，作为始终把恋爱当作课题的我，也实在无法置之不理……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1014_004yuk", "source_sha256": "aadcda32fdc4ca7751fa426dd65b0d47ba489d763baee1622c569c80a21ab9a5", "ja": "そういえば……歌詞の意味は、私もあんまり\n考えてなかったかも？", "zh": "说起来……歌词的含义，我好像也没怎么考虑过？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1015_p", "source_sha256": "488919aa8e8496d50b70d75f014765c9bd63f40518f0db5cd2caeaa50c4e28f8", "ja": "じゃあ、みんなで歌詞を読んでみるか。\nはい、これがあずささんの新曲の歌詞カードだよ。", "zh": "那么，大家一起读读歌词吧。\n来，这就是あずさ的新歌歌词卡。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1016_null", "source_sha256": "4384d8d57323d777cbbe0bcde05f49cd8566e94e0f154a3c4657d01bbe03385a", "ja": "―数分後―", "zh": "——几分钟后——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "c346d82ad6918e23bf23f5e6972128ceea2fa27fc67fdc3d60b3b3f586b48e35", "ja": "はぁぁぁぁ……！！", "zh": "哈啊啊啊啊……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c346d82ad6918e23bf23f5e6972128ceea2fa27fc67fdc3d60b3b3f586b48e35", "ja": "はぁぁぁぁ……！！", "zh": "哈啊啊啊啊……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "75447497193531cf716a4aedec955e83420423efe204346972d9e78bcb12ca2e", "ja": "激しい～！　いかにも大人の女って感じ！\nあはは、アタシにはまだ無理かな。真美はいける？", "zh": "好激烈～！简直就是成熟女人的感觉！\n\n啊哈哈，我现在还不行吧。真美，你可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1020_012mam", "source_sha256": "2ce1f1bc443c94dca6a5472619b8865f3f03a9d0f0b7a0faf5bdbf3d9e594d3a", "ja": "うんっ、ドキドキだけどぜんぜんヘッチャだよ！\nアイシテ～ん♪", "zh": "嗯！虽然心里扑通扑通的，但完全没问题啦！\n爱我嘛～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "3be2ad38ad626c2e11636240432500816248d41094def3b9b75339b07f799726", "ja": "あ、あ、愛を求めちゃうとか……、\n私にはレベルが高すぎます！　きゃー！", "zh": "啊、啊、居然要、要寻求爱什么的……  \n对我来说等级太高了！呀——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1022_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a2dbc71dd9c260cfdc947325d7a57c0142ca972d5b66625adf26382dc0a26e05", "ja": "ううっ、ごめんなさい！　歌詞の意味もよくわかって\nなかったくせに、ステキとか言ってごめんなさい～！", "zh": "呜呜，对不起！明明都没太搞懂\n歌词的意思，还说什么太棒了，对不起～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1023_010azu", "source_sha256": "54840ac9420603b21265293fba9fab8df648f25cc4d7837fef96d06fcd6d96c7", "ja": "ふふ、やっぱりみんな、ドキドキするのね。\nよかったわ、私だけじゃなくて。", "zh": "呵呵，果然大家都会心跳加速呢。\n太好了，不是只有我会这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "30619e6d538976b4e1f992f64304a2a2b082dd028e3f344769f56e464138194f", "ja": "はっ！　すみません、あずささん！　私、先生って\n紹介されたのに、騒いだだけで役に立たなくて……。", "zh": "啊！对不起，梓小姐！明明被介绍成老师，我却只顾着大惊小怪，什么忙都没帮上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1025_012mam", "source_sha256": "be9692ea893c405f1f9bc121f80a5a75464718d83885a35a6ac07aa6de742fff", "ja": "ゆーりが謝ることじゃないっしょー。\nね、兄ちゃん？", "zh": "这又不是百合子该道歉的事吧——对吧，哥哥？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1026_p", "source_sha256": "afd620810246c7b63d9e938b0b2fbd83a34e9c98b95dd20ca3d923e4fe93e126", "ja": "ああ、真美が偉そうにすることでもないぞ？", "zh": "啊，也不是真美摆出一副了不起的样子的时候吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1027_043nor", "source_sha256": "291bf4f83cffa171dd00a581a2f2c29232f58db888235557b7fba0dfab86d44d", "ja": "でも、愛かぁ。まさにそんな感じの歌だよね、百合子！", "zh": "不过，爱情啊。确实就是这种感觉的歌呢，百合子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1028_026yur", "source_sha256": "265421338bb96d3dab29d2512751f64ae318242418c13558ac6813ed938265cb", "ja": "い、いえ。恋もままならない私が、\n愛を口にしてしまうなんて……うう、恥ずかしい……。", "zh": "不、不行。连恋爱都还没搞明白的我，居然说起了爱……呜呜，好羞耻……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1029_010azu", "source_sha256": "ec88227cd32486379074c49be8a2f6accc0f64ee5098504924967c0ed9733606", "ja": "私も同じよ、百合子ちゃん。大人って言っても、\n恋も愛も、私にはまだ難しくて。でも……。", "zh": "我也一样哦，百合子。虽然说是大人了，可恋爱和爱情对我来说还是很难。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1030_p", "source_sha256": "f9b525ff68ef0be4eab4e4d216fdf99a02389875dd45c7af648328aaca57c044", "ja": "でも……、どうしました？", "zh": "不过……怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1031_010azu", "source_sha256": "9f94fe56288fb2531231eeeae325342dc79b64db9cbc43574f37e00d2b218539", "ja": "あ、いえ。……ただ、ちゃんと歌いたいって思って。\n私、頑張りますね、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "啊，没什么……只是，想着要好好唱这首歌。\n我会努力的，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1032_p", "source_sha256": "047e97ae9d51cdc5162d530cec5e4e793e7faca27572b9e083b7a9d85cc573d7", "ja": "（不安がありながらも、あずささんは用意したこの曲に\n前向きに取り組んでくれている。それなら……）", "zh": "（尽管心里有些不安，梓小姐还是积极地投入了准备好的这首歌。既然如此……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_075_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_075_1033_p", "source_sha256": "866aacaa83a11d72ceeeba506f5f682c646acb5eaf48fbe92fb0490008427909", "ja": "あずささん、ちょっといいですか？\n今日のこの後の予定なんですけど……。", "zh": "梓小姐，方便打扰一下吗？\n关于今天接下来的安排……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
